[e00128] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks, Caroline! These are for running. Been running longer since our last chat - a great way to destress and clear my mind. [Public image caption: a photo of a pair of pink sneakers in a box]

[e00129] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow! What got you into running?

[e00130] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
I've been running farther to de-stress, which has been great for my headspace.

[e00131] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Cool, Melanie! Running can really boost your mood. Keep it up!

[e00132] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks, Caroline! This has been great for my mental health. I'm gonna keep it up.

[e00133] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Awesome, Melanie! Mental health's a priority, so make sure you take care of yourself.

[e00134] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Caroline, thanks! Mental health is important to me, and it's made such an improvement!

[e00135] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Glad it helped ya, Melanie!

[e00136] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Mel, what's up? Been a busy week since we talked.

[e00137] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Caroline, it's been super busy here. So much since we talked! Last Fri I finally took my kids to a pottery workshop. We all made our own pots, it was fun and therapeutic! [Public image caption: a photography of a group of children making clay sculptures in a classroom]

[e00138] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, Mel! Sounds like you and the kids had a blast. How'd they like it?

[e00139] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
The kids loved it! They were so excited to get their hands dirty and make something with clay. It was special to watch their creativity and imagination come to life, they made this! [Public image caption: a photo of a cup with a dog face on it]

[e00140] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Aww, that's so sweet! That cup is so cute. It's awesome to see how kids show their personalities through art. What other creative projects do you do with them, besides pottery?

[e00141] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
We love painting together lately, especially nature-inspired ones. Here's our latest work from last weekend. [Public image caption: a photo of a painting of a sunset with a palm tree]

[e00142] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow Mel, that painting's amazing! The colors are so bold and it really highlights the beauty of nature. Y'all work on it together?

[e00143] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks, Caroline! We both helped with the painting - it was great bonding over it and chatting about nature. We found these lovely flowers. Appreciating the small things in life, too. [Public image caption: a photo of a field of purple flowers with green leaves]

[e00144] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
That photo is stunning! So glad you bonded over our love of nature. Last Friday I went to a council meeting for adoption. It was inspiring and emotional - so many people wanted to create loving homes for children in need. It made me even more determined to adopt.

[e00145] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, Caroline, way to go! Your future fam will get a kick out of having you. What do you think of these? [Public image caption: a photo of a blue vase with a bouquet of sunflowers and roses]

[e00146] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks Melanie - love the blue vase in the pic! Blue's my fave, it makes me feel relaxed. Sunflowers mean warmth and happiness, right? While roses stand for love and beauty? That's neat. What do flowers mean to you?

[e00147] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Flowers bring joy. They represent growth, beauty and reminding us to appreciate the small moments. They were an important part of my wedding decor and always remind me of that day. [Public image caption: a photo of a row of white chairs with flowers on them]

[e00148] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
It must have been special at your wedding. I wish I had known you back then!

[e00149] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
It was amazing, Caroline. The day was full of love and joy. Everyone we love was there to celebrate us - it was really special. [Public image caption: a photo of a wedding ceremony in a greenhouse with people taking pictures]

[e00150] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, what a great day! Glad everyone could make it. What was your favorite part?

[e00151] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Marrying my partner and promising to be together forever was the best part. [Public image caption: a photo of a man and woman standing on a beach]

[e00152] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, nice pic! You both looked amazing. One special memory for me was this pride parade I went to a few weeks ago. [Public image caption: a photo of a parade with people walking down the street]

[e00153] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, looks awesome! Did you join in?

[e00154] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yes, I did. It was amazing! I felt so accepted and happy, just being around people who accepted and celebrated me. It's definitely a top memory. [Public image caption: a photo of a group of people holding up signs and smiling]

[e00155] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, what an experience! How did it make you feel?

[e00156] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
I felt so proud and grateful - the vibes were amazing and it was comforting to know I'm not alone and have a great community around me. [Public image caption: a photo of a rainbow flag on a pole on a carpet]

[e00157] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, Caroline! That's huge! How did it feel to be around so much love and acceptance?

[e00158] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
It was awesome, Melanie! Being around people who embrace and back me up is beyond words. It really inspired me. [Public image caption: a photo of a group of people sitting on the ground with a dog]

[e00159] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, that sounds awesome! Your friends and community really have your back. What's been the best part of it? [Public image caption: a photo of a girl sitting in a teepee with stuffed animals]

[e00160] time=1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Realizing I can be me without fear and having the courage to transition was the best part. It's so freeing to express myself authentically and have people back me up. [Public image caption: a photo of a teepee with a teddy bear and pillows]
